<h5>Microsatellite Repeat</h5>
<p>
    A variety of simple di- (DINUCLEOTIDE REPEATS), tri- (TRINUCLEOTIDE REPEATS), tetra-,
    and pentanucleotide tandem repeats (usually less than 100 bases long).
</p>

<h5>Tandem repeats</h5>
<p>Copies of DNA sequences which lie adjacent to each other.</p>

<h5>Related terms</h5>
<p>
    Simple Tandem Repeats (STR), Exact Tandem Repeats (ETRs), Short Sequence Repeats (SSRs),
    Repetitive DNA, Simple Sequence Repeats (SSR).
</p>
